s likely Hardware/OS specific)\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nAny Mobile project will cause this issue. Instead here's part of the crash report from Apple:\n\n[Godot Crash Report.txt](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/22223720/Godot.Crash.Report.txt)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110334/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110334/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}